# Files that the image build itself owns when it builds from packages
# (TSX_FROM_PACKAGES=1, docs/rootfs.md "Build from packages"). The profile meta
# package (tsx-xx60-console, -kiosk or -ha) and the packages it pulls own every
# other file of rootfs/overlay. profile.sh stage-image copies only these files.
# A file here that the profile does not have (the profile marker of the ha
# profile, for example) is not copied. Format: image PATH, relative to the root
# of the image. The build takes the file from rootfs/overlay, or from
# profiles/NAME/overlay when the profile has its own copy.
image etc/fstab
image etc/inittab
image etc/tsx/profile
